{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"同调"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"同调"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p><strong>同调</strong>在数学上有许多含义. 其共性是一种表现得像"},{"Local":{"url":"张量积","text":"张量积"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"余极限","text":"余极限"}},{"Plain":"那样的协变函子. 而与之相对的"},{"Local":{"url":"上同调","text":"上同调"}},{"Plain":"则是一种表现得像 Hom, "},{"Local":{"url":"极限","text":"极限"}},{"Plain":"那样的反变函子.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":" $X$ 的<strong>同调群</strong> $H_n(X)$ 是其"},{"Local":{"url":"自由-遗忘伴随","text":"自由"}},{"Plain":"生成的交换群 (见 "},{"Local":{"url":"Dold–Thom定理","text":"Dold–Thom 定理"}},{"Plain":") 对应的"},{"Local":{"url":"连合谱","text":"连合谱"}},{"Plain":" $\\Sigma^\\infty X \\wedge H\\mathbb{Z}$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"同伦群(稳定同伦论)","text":"同伦群"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\nH_n(X) = \\pi_n(\\Sigma^\\infty X \\wedge H\\mathbb{Z}).\r\n$$</p>\n<h3>广义同调</h3>\n<p>$$\r\nE_n(X) := \\pi_n (\\Sigma^\\infty X \\wedge E).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>见"},{"Local":{"url":"广义同调","text":"广义同调"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>Dold–Thom 定理</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Dold–Thom定理","text":"Dold–Thom 定理"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}